        "description": {
          "type": "/type/text",
          "value": "Architects of the Web presents the history of the Web's creation and evolution - as well as its emergence as a dynamic business tool - through revealing profiles of its architects, the brilliant minds who have helped thrust the Web onto desktops and corporate agendas around the world. On the cutting edge of the online revolution, these visionaries have all made vital contributions to the advancement and enhancement of the Web that will define the way we conduct business in the future."
